Human confirmed on 2026-10-30 that 3D Hands is independently developed, that the original contributions are held by the developer with authority to license them, and that the authorized original contributions may be fully open sourced under the public attribution Clarke-art.

* Original software: MIT License. The complete grant and notice are in LICENSES/MIT.txt.
* Original research documents: Creative Commons Attribution 4.0 International (CC BY 4.0), attributed to Clarke-art (2026).
* Authorized original model contributions and research data/media: CC BY 4.0, attributed to Clarke-art (2026). This grant covers only original contributions; retain upstream ancestry, source notices and third-party rights.

The complete CC BY 4.0 text is in LICENSES/CC-BY-4.0.txt; canonical terms: https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by/4.0/ . Give appropriate credit to Clarke-art, link the license and indicate changes, while retaining applicable source notices.

Third-party content retains its original terms. PianoPlayer retains MIT and Copyright (c) 2017 Marco Musy; Blender Human Base Meshes retains its CC0 source notices; Mutopia editions retain the saved public-domain edition provenance. Other resources follow their upstream terms. No project-wide MIT license applies to all files. No license is granted over excluded or uncleared external motion, weights or reference data.

COPYRIGHT.md and THIRD_PARTY_NOTICES.md define attribution and exceptions. release-assets/R2_LICENSE_SCOPE.csv binds the selected Git files and unchanged 18 ZIP payloads to these licenses. R1 manifests and notices inside ZIPs remain historical evidence; the current scope table and this declaration record the later authorization without rewriting those bytes. Additional original R2 publication documentation follows CC BY 4.0; the MIT license grant itself applies to original software.

The repository remains Private and the research Release remains Draft. Copyright/license authorization is confirmed; final permission to switch Public or publish the Release is still withheld pending Human's final review.
